From a54c32ecb1b3a617f3b43c60da97d4b757f18ab7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ashish Chauhan <ashish.chauhan@imgtec.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:43:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pvr: Validate XFB primitive topology at draw

XFB programs are built at Begin from the current topology, which may
be unset with dynamic topology. Check the cached vertex count at draw
and, on a mismatch, end XFB, barrier and kick again.

Fixes: c374fb7308eb ("pvr: add transform feedback entry points support")
Signed-off-by: Ashish Chauhan <ashish.chauhan@imgtec.com>
Reviewed-by: Simon Perretta <simon.perretta@imgtec.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45632>
(cherry picked from commit fef00314b672e7c88b37e5054a1c7226352ec8d8)

Conflicts:
	src/imagination/ci/axe-1-16m-fails.txt
Link: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/a54c32ecb1b3a617f3b43c60da97d4b757f18ab7
[ adapted: dropped .pick_status.json, not in the 26.3.0 tarball or bookkeeping only ]
